  text: "All Abilities must have 2 Main Transitions:\n\n1:  [Exit]  to Finish the
    Animation\n     - No Conditions\n     - Has Exit Time  = True\n\n2: [Interrupt]
    the Mode \n     - Condition -> ModeStatus = -2\n     - Has Exit Time  = False\n\n(Optional)\n3:
    You can also Interrupt the Mode if [Movement] is detected\n\n     - Condition
    -> Movement = true\n     - Has Exit Time  = False\n\n\nThe last one is use for
    Sleep, Sit, Lie..etc"
